OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland Troubles Bill to
OL,4,Abe debated in House of Commons
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour's Northern Ireland Troubles Bill
OL,7,Fwill return to the House of Commons
OL,8,Flater on Monday for hours of debate
OL,9,Fbefore MPs vote on proposed changes to
OL,10,Fthe legislation.
OL,12,FLast week, the government published
OL,13,Fhundreds of amendments, including that
OL,14,Fthe attorney general must provide
OL,15,Fconsent for any serious prosecutions
OL,16,Frelated to the Troubles under the new
OL,17,Fplan.
OL,19,FThe legislation seeks to deal with the
OL,20,Funresolved legacy of the decades-long
OL,21,Fviolent conflict which cost the lives
OL,22,Fof more than 3,500 people.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
