OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland Troubles Bill to
OL,4,Abe debated in House of Commons
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been more than a year since it
OL,7,Fwas first introduced to Parliament,
OL,8,Ffollowing agreement on a joint
OL,9,Fframework with the Irish government.
